      {
         "IntroSequence": {
            "SequenceItems": [
               {
                  "Type": "SlideShow",
                  "Data": {
                     "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/yamato_empire_of_the_rising_sun/6/intro/%d.png",
                     "Slides": [
                        {
                           "Duration": 35.9,
                           "TextFadeDuration": 35.699999999999996,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Asuka, 645 CE\n\nThe Soga must be stopped! Since the days of Prince Shōtoku, the clan has had its thumb on the Imperial family, but now, they have gone too far. They plan to depose your mother, the Empress, and put a more compliant puppet on the Imperial throne. Prince Naka no Ōe, you must defeat the Soga and finally drive them from power, but exercise caution. They control the Imperial capital, and you are not yet in a strong position to confront them. You may need to hide your intentions by offering the Soga gifts of peace until you are powerful enough to defeat them.",
                           "ImageRect": {
                              "x": 0,
                              "y": 0,
                              "width": 3840,
                              "height": 2160
                           },
                           "TextRect": {
