      {
         "IntroSequence": {
            "SequenceItems": [
               {
                  "Type": "SlideShow",
                  "Data": {
                     "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/yamato_empire_of_the_rising_sun/7/intro/%d.png",
                     "Slides": [
                        {
                           "Duration": 30.9,
                           "TextFadeDuration": 30.7,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Ōtsu, 672 CE\n\nPrince Ōama, your elder brother, Emperor Tenji, has passed from this world. Though he was a great man, his final act was a grave mistake: he named a son of a lowborn wife as Emperor. This will ruin the authority and legitimacy of the Emperor as a descendant of gods on both family lines. What will the Chinese Emperor think of Japan now that it is ruled by a man of low birth? You have no choice, Prince Ōama. You must depose your nephew and take the Chrysanthemum Throne of Japan.",
                           "ImageRect": {
                              "x": 0,
                              "y": 0,
                              "width": 3840,
                              "height": 2160
                           },
                           "TextRect": {
